  sentences:
    nameNPC: "T\xF4i"
    Lines:
    - "(Tr\u1EA7m ng\xE2m, r\u1ED3i ch\u1EADm r\xE3i n\xF3i) Thi\xEAn h\u1EA1 tuy
      chia m\u01B0\u1EDDi hai, nh\u01B0ng kh\xF4ng ai th\u1EADt l\xF2ng ngh\u0129
      cho d\xE2n. N\u1EBFu ch\u1EC9 c\xE1t c\u1EE9, s\u1EBD m\xE1u ch\u1EA3y ru\u1ED9ng
      \u0111\u1ED3ng."
    - "Hoa L\u01B0 n\xE0y tuy nh\u1ECF, nh\u01B0ng n\xFAi s\xF4ng ch\u1EDF che, l\xF2ng
      ng\u01B0\u1EDDi h\u01B0\u1EDBng v\u1EC1. T\u1EEB \u0111\xE2y m\xE0 d\u1EF1ng
      nghi\u1EC7p, s\u1EBD l\xE0 ch\u1ED7 d\u1EF1a cho c\u1EA3 thi\xEAn h\u1EA1."
